      font-size: 12px;
      color: var(--ink);
    }

    /* Impact chip — three clearly distinct tiers.
     *   HIGH    = filled accent red,  white text       (loudest)
     *   MEDIUM  = filled ink (black), white text       (mid weight)
     *   LOW     = hollow, grey hairline + grey text    (quietest)
